# Normalize to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: scripts/check_mirrors.py compares the
# canonical skill to its mirrors by SHA-256 of the raw bytes, and
# tests/test_always_on_hooks.py asserts that the Node, sh, and PowerShell hooks
# emit the same body byte for byte. A CRLF checkout on Windows would break both.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
